==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|copweb}}, {{m|enm|coppeweb}}, equivalent to {{compound|en|cop|t1=spider|web}}. Compare {{cog|dum|kopwebbe}}, {{cog|nds-de|Kobbenwebbe}} {{i|Westphalian}}.

